==Battleground==
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns.
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
As this stage consists entirely of [[:Category:Unstarred Alien Enemies|Aliens]] at high strength magnification, all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|Anti-unstarred Alien treasures]] and using [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien Cats]] is essential for winning this stage. Once you get all crystals, this is essentially just ItF Floating Continent 3, but now you have [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

